    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443710/extras/6bec75d8cb8cad59aedc2b369f7effe1.avif?t=1755205534\" width=616 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 The year is 198X,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0The powers that be have gone silent,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 Humanity is unrestrained, the party will never stop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443710/extras/fb9f4473b7dc91a132b5636e00b8c025.avif?t=1755205534\" width=616 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0Vice grips every corner of the city, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0Indulgence is at an all-time high, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 A new kind of doctrine festers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443710/extras/333b9b20e4dbfef3480711fe5edee161.avif?t=1755205534\" width=616 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RitualRX</strong> is a <strong>brutally violent</strong>, <strong>blisteringly fast</strong>, <strong>adrenaline-pumping</strong> shooter set within a pastel paradise ruled by cults. Control a group of excommunicated sinners as you shoot, slash, and slaughter your way through a city where ritual is prescribed and the only treatment administered is an overdose of lead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lightning fast and brutal combat</strong> where everything is a weapon. Kick down doors and cave in skulls, throw everything and tackle enemies- ignite, cut, and blast your way through intricate sandbox-like levels as you master increasingly brutal methods of dispatching your foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443710/extras/6a9740127e6d0d890506bf032d3280df.avif?t=1755205534\" data-has-big width=800 height=332 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Control  a group of excommunicated sinners</strong>. A dishonored SWAT officer, a cultist detective, a vampiric vigilante, and more- all bound to unending violence by dark forces. Step into their shoes, mastering their unique  abilities and traits; charge forward and impale with lethal antlers, stab and throw with a razor-sharp tail, even control time and rewrite history. Each blessing is not without it's curses however; A relentless craving for blood, excommunication, an unpaid deal with arcane forces; all are at the mercy of their own sins.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443710/extras/6bec75d8cb8cad59aedc2b369f7effe1.avif?t=1755205534\" width=616 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 The year is 198X,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0The powers that be have gone silent,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 Humanity is unrestrained, the party will never stop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443710/extras/fb9f4473b7dc91a132b5636e00b8c025.avif?t=1755205534\" width=616 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0Vice grips every corner of the city, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0Indulgence is at an all-time high, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 A new kind of doctrine festers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443710/extras/333b9b20e4dbfef3480711fe5edee161.avif?t=1755205534\" width=616 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RitualRX</strong> is a <strong>brutally violent</strong>, <strong>blisteringly fast</strong>, <strong>adrenaline-pumping</strong> shooter set within a pastel paradise ruled by cults. Control a group of excommunicated sinners as you shoot, slash, and slaughter your way through a city where ritual is prescribed and the only treatment administered is an overdose of lead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lightning fast and brutal combat</strong> where everything is a weapon. Kick down doors and cave in skulls, throw everything and tackle enemies- ignite, cut, and blast your way through intricate sandbox-like levels as you master increasingly brutal methods of dispatching your foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443710/extras/6a9740127e6d0d890506bf032d3280df.avif?t=1755205534\" data-has-big width=800 height=332 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Control  a group of excommunicated sinners</strong>. A dishonored SWAT officer, a cultist detective, a vampiric vigilante, and more- all bound to unending violence by dark forces. Step into their shoes, mastering their unique  abilities and traits; charge forward and impale with lethal antlers, stab and throw with a razor-sharp tail, even control time and rewrite history. Each blessing is not without it's curses however; A relentless craving for blood, excommunication, an unpaid deal with arcane forces; all are at the mercy of their own sins.</p>",
